# With a value, the value must agree with the declaration: the shape, the
# unit (if one is declared), and the properties (if any are declared).
A: PositiveDefinite Matrix[3, 3]
B: Symmetric Matrix[3, 3] = A
C: Matrix[3, 3] = A
m: kg = 2 kg
k: Scalar = 3
v: Vector[3] m/s
w: Vector[3] m/s = v
u: Vector[3] = 2 * v
D: Diagonal Matrix[3, 3]
E: Symmetric Matrix[3, 3] = 2 * D
p = 2 * A
F: Symmetric Matrix[3, 3] = p
